WEBVTT

00:43.126 --> 00:44.794
Aren't you happy to be out here?

00:45.628 --> 00:46.463
I am.

00:46.546 --> 00:49.132
You always talked
about wanting to relax somewhere,

00:49.215 --> 00:51.384
- and you're finally here.
- Yes, I am.

00:53.011 --> 00:54.721
Do you often go on trips?

00:55.722 --> 00:56.723
I do.

01:00.477 --> 01:01.686
Any memorable trips?

01:05.899 --> 01:07.692
Which trip was the most memorable?

01:10.278 --> 01:12.280
Despite not wanting to remember,

01:12.363 --> 01:15.450
there's one trip that I just can't forget.

01:15.533 --> 01:16.826
Did you not hear the question?

01:17.619 --> 01:19.162
And it's also…

01:21.039 --> 01:22.499
Hey, Ung.

01:24.501 --> 01:25.543
TWO DAYS BEFORE UNG'S DEPARTURE

01:25.627 --> 01:27.003
Hey, Ung.

01:28.630 --> 01:29.881
…with Yeon-su.

01:33.593 --> 01:35.220
Ung.

01:35.303 --> 01:39.557
Ung.

01:44.521 --> 01:46.022
Are you ignoring me?

01:47.941 --> 01:49.067
Didn't we break up?

01:49.150 --> 01:51.319
Really? Did we?

01:52.779 --> 01:55.740
How could you tell me
to just go so easily?

01:55.824 --> 01:58.785
Because you should.
The school is covering the costs.

01:59.410 --> 02:01.663
Are you fine
with being apart for six months?

02:02.872 --> 02:06.042
This is a great opportunity for you
to learn many new things.

02:06.709 --> 02:08.002
Of course, you should go.

02:13.550 --> 02:14.717
Let's go on a trip.

02:14.801 --> 02:17.512
You can go alone.
I'll be going on a long one soon anyway.

02:18.513 --> 02:20.348
Hurry. We need to leave.

02:20.431 --> 02:21.516
Where to?

02:21.599 --> 02:23.893
You wanted to see the sea, so let's go.

02:23.977 --> 02:24.811
Right now?

02:24.894 --> 02:28.022
Just like now, I had no say on this trip.

02:28.106 --> 02:30.316
Yes. I bought the bus tickets already.
Come on.

02:31.109 --> 02:34.028
Why didn't you tell me about this sooner?

02:34.112 --> 02:38.658
SUWON, JANGAN, HOGOK-RI

02:38.741 --> 02:40.326
Don't you smell the sea already?

02:40.410 --> 02:41.494
It was barely a trip.

02:41.578 --> 02:43.204
Who is this trip for?

02:43.288 --> 02:46.749
There's no time. We need to hurry
if we want to catch the bus back.

02:46.833 --> 02:48.084
Is this what I think it is?

02:50.545 --> 02:51.754
Our final trip together?

02:53.256 --> 02:54.966
How could I forget that trip?

02:55.049 --> 02:56.801
Let's hurry. We need to get a move on.

02:57.510 --> 02:58.511
Thank you.

02:58.595 --> 02:59.512
- Enjoy.
- Thanks.

02:59.596 --> 03:02.640
Check this out.
Doesn't it look scrumptious?

03:06.477 --> 03:08.396
It's my treat, so eat up.

03:09.105 --> 03:10.106
Here.

03:11.691 --> 03:13.610
Is this The Last Supper or something?

03:14.277 --> 03:16.779
Look at how plump this is.
I've never had this before.

03:18.990 --> 03:21.159
Are you going to treat me to a nice meal

03:21.242 --> 03:22.619
then leave me here?

03:23.328 --> 03:24.579
Just eat.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.874
Eat up. Today is going to be a busy day.

03:27.957 --> 03:29.667
She did whatever she liked.

03:33.755 --> 03:35.715
I'll take it now.

03:35.798 --> 03:36.716
By myself?

03:36.799 --> 03:38.718
Smile. They're all waiting.

03:38.801 --> 03:41.387
- Why aren't you taking it with me?
- All right.

03:41.471 --> 03:43.223
Is this really our final trip?

03:43.306 --> 03:44.807
Before we break up?

03:44.891 --> 03:46.184
I could never read her.

03:46.267 --> 03:48.186
One, two, three.

03:51.189 --> 03:52.482
Done. Let's go.

04:05.328 --> 04:07.413
Can't I just appreciate the view?

04:07.497 --> 04:09.332
You need photos to reminisce.

04:09.999 --> 04:12.085
I want to ponder a bit.

04:12.877 --> 04:13.711
About what?

04:14.379 --> 04:16.047
About our future.

04:16.130 --> 04:19.133
Come on. Why bother
thinking about that while on a trip?

04:19.217 --> 04:22.470
I was thinking about it at home,
but then you dragged me here.

04:23.137 --> 04:26.182
Look at this. You look like a wild deer.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.310
Are you ignoring
everything that I'm saying?

04:29.894 --> 04:32.105
What a shame.
It would have been better during the day.

04:33.106 --> 04:35.525
She never listened to me
and had her way with me.

04:36.442 --> 04:39.237
Hey. Smile, will you?

04:39.320 --> 04:41.739
I feel like I'm talking to a wall.

04:43.116 --> 04:45.576
We're running out of time.
We need to go to the market.

04:46.327 --> 04:47.996
Hey, let's go.

05:06.222 --> 05:07.181
Take a look.

05:07.265 --> 05:09.600
- What would you like?
- It's a long arm octopus.

05:09.684 --> 05:12.020
- Gosh, they're very fresh.
- Can I touch it?

05:12.103 --> 05:13.229
Of course.

05:15.273 --> 05:16.441
Stop that.

05:16.524 --> 05:19.360
- Goodness. He's such a scaredy-cat.
- Where are you going?

05:31.122 --> 05:32.123
Let's go.

05:34.625 --> 05:35.710
And…

05:37.003 --> 05:38.212
Look at the crabs.

05:38.296 --> 05:45.261
SUWON, JANGAN, HOGOK-RI

05:55.229 --> 05:57.482
Wasn't today fun?

06:02.779 --> 06:03.863
Are you sleeping?

06:18.252 --> 06:20.421
You always frown in your sleep.

06:24.342 --> 06:25.718
- Here.
- Thanks.

06:31.432 --> 06:34.602
Next time, let's take a longer trip.

06:37.313 --> 06:40.525
I took up an extra part-time job,
so I've been way too busy.

06:40.608 --> 06:43.820
I was going to take
the morning shift off but I couldn't.

06:45.196 --> 06:46.948
It was hectic, wasn't it?

06:47.615 --> 06:49.992
This was my first trip,
so I'm still new to it.

06:51.202 --> 06:54.330
Next time, let's stay longer
and go farther away.

06:55.498 --> 06:57.375
Do you want me with you next time too?

06:57.458 --> 06:59.877
Who am I supposed to go with?
Should I go by myself?

07:00.711 --> 07:03.172
She was always like that.

07:04.757 --> 07:07.468
Hey. Are you really stupid?

07:07.552 --> 07:09.637
Why would we break up?

07:09.720 --> 07:13.432
Then you should have told me
instead of making me feel anxious.

07:13.516 --> 07:15.143
Must I say it out loud?

07:15.226 --> 07:16.227
Can't you tell?

07:16.310 --> 07:18.438
I can't. I still can't.

07:18.521 --> 07:21.357
Unless you tell me, I can't read you.

07:27.864 --> 07:28.865
Choi Ung.

07:32.118 --> 07:32.994
Ung.

07:39.417 --> 07:40.501
Look at me.

07:44.547 --> 07:46.048
We're not going to break up.

07:48.259 --> 07:51.762
If we fight or break up again,

07:53.014 --> 07:56.225
just come to me like you did today.

07:58.227 --> 08:00.354
- And then?
- Then…

08:14.494 --> 08:16.871
You could have smiled like this
for the photos.

08:16.954 --> 08:18.706
I need to look at them while you're gone.

08:19.290 --> 08:21.042
Is that why you took them?

08:21.709 --> 08:23.794
You know what? Let's take one now.

08:23.878 --> 08:25.338
- Here?
- Yes.

08:27.757 --> 08:29.467
Okay. Smile.

08:32.345 --> 08:34.680
At times, she'd feel extremely distant.

08:34.764 --> 08:36.766
Other times, she'd pull me closer…

08:38.976 --> 08:40.144
Why aren't you taking it?

08:46.817 --> 08:49.445
What's wrong? Do I have an ugly smile?

08:54.200 --> 08:57.537
I think I love you.

08:59.622 --> 09:03.042
…and make time stop.

09:05.753 --> 09:07.129
Did you know that?

09:13.386 --> 09:14.512
No.

09:19.684 --> 09:20.851
I don't.

09:22.770 --> 09:24.146
So remind me every time.

09:28.276 --> 09:29.902
So how could I forget that moment?

09:35.658 --> 09:37.368
I had no idea then.

09:45.835 --> 09:46.919
I'm not sure.

09:48.004 --> 09:49.922
I don't really enjoy going on trips.

09:51.757 --> 09:53.968
That the promises you make on a trip…

09:54.051 --> 09:55.761
There's nothing memorable.

09:55.845 --> 09:57.638
…are all lies.

10:04.478 --> 10:10.067
EPISODE 8
BEFORE SUNSET

10:12.194 --> 10:15.656
Honestly, I don't know what's going on.
I tagged along just in case.

10:15.740 --> 10:20.369
I do suspect that something's going on
between those two.

10:21.245 --> 10:23.581
Ung has always been irresponsible,

10:23.664 --> 10:26.292
so it's normal for him
to run away or not pick up my calls.

10:26.375 --> 10:28.085
But Yeon-su ran away too.

10:28.169 --> 10:33.049
That made me think
something was going on between the two.

10:33.132 --> 10:35.134
Anyway, I'm not here to relax.

10:35.217 --> 10:38.429
How do I put it?
I'm here to keep an eye on them.

10:40.514 --> 10:42.600
It's my duty as his manager

10:43.476 --> 10:45.728
to take care of his mental health.

10:46.562 --> 10:48.356
They'll figure it out.

10:48.439 --> 10:50.733
After all, they're adults.

10:51.817 --> 10:54.153
But seeing how childish they still are,

10:54.236 --> 10:56.322
I guess I'm the only one
who's growing old.

10:59.033 --> 11:01.369
Oh, my. I didn't know I brought this.

11:01.869 --> 11:05.039
Is there someplace I can swim
around here? Perhaps, an indoor pool?

11:05.748 --> 11:09.335
Anyway, you guys were smart
to lock them up in here.

11:09.418 --> 11:12.129
They're extremely irresponsible.

11:13.381 --> 11:15.591
I'm sure I brought some hangover medicine.

11:15.675 --> 11:18.344
I heard you've known them
for a very long time.

11:19.011 --> 11:21.305
Would you say
that they have changed over time?

11:24.517 --> 11:27.436
To be honest,
they haven't changed one bit.

11:27.520 --> 11:29.980
They were a headache back then,

11:30.064 --> 11:31.690
and they still are.

11:31.774 --> 11:35.194
They're a nuisance
to everyone around them.

11:36.570 --> 11:38.155
By the way, where are they?

11:38.948 --> 11:40.616
Don't tell me they're arguing.

11:48.791 --> 11:50.584
Things have gotten worse.

11:51.710 --> 11:54.755
Why now? Why did we have
to go on this ridiculous trip?

12:14.108 --> 12:17.403
if you were going to run away,
you should have gone farther.

12:18.696 --> 12:21.115
That's rich coming from you.
You were caught too.

12:22.700 --> 12:24.743
So? Have you given up?

12:25.578 --> 12:27.288
Are you going to keep filming?

12:28.164 --> 12:30.291
What choice do I have?

12:37.173 --> 12:38.591
You said you were sick of me.

12:40.676 --> 12:43.679
How can we be in the same place
if you're that sick of me?

12:56.358 --> 12:58.277
We really came on another trip.

12:58.360 --> 12:59.820
Next time, let's stay longer.

12:59.904 --> 13:01.238
And it's longer.

13:01.322 --> 13:02.740
And go farther away.

13:02.823 --> 13:03.991
And farther away.

13:05.951 --> 13:06.869
What?

13:09.705 --> 13:12.917
Isn't it the same for you?
You must be sick of this too.

13:15.336 --> 13:17.713
We fight, avoid each other, and run away.

13:18.422 --> 13:19.632
That's what we do.

13:20.508 --> 13:21.967
And now, here we are.

13:23.552 --> 13:24.637
What can we do though?

13:36.941 --> 13:38.317
Do you want some privacy?

13:40.945 --> 13:42.988
No, I'll leave.

13:58.587 --> 14:02.007
Why did I have to remember that now?

14:16.272 --> 14:18.607
Gosh, what a nice view.

14:19.525 --> 14:21.777
Why are you breathing down my neck?

14:22.778 --> 14:25.823
I look forward to learning
many things from you on this trip.

14:25.906 --> 14:28.450
I'll observe every little thing you do.

14:28.534 --> 14:32.037
You better step back
unless you want to be let go.

14:34.331 --> 14:37.668
I already told you, but I'm truly glad
to be a part of your team.

14:37.751 --> 14:40.546
Both you and Ms. Jung
are incredibly talented.

14:40.629 --> 14:41.881
I'm very eager to learn.

14:41.964 --> 14:43.799
I don't like repetition.

14:44.383 --> 14:45.217
I see.

14:46.594 --> 14:48.262
You have two jobs.

14:48.345 --> 14:49.555
Anything, sir!

14:49.638 --> 14:52.766
Number one. Always be ready
to give Chae-ran what she needs.

14:52.850 --> 14:55.686
- I can do that.
- Number two. You shouldn't block my view

14:55.769 --> 14:57.354
when I look around.

15:01.650 --> 15:02.818
What should you do then?

15:05.613 --> 15:06.780
That's it. Simple, right?

15:08.282 --> 15:10.826
Anyway, I'll do my best.

15:10.910 --> 15:13.913
I know you're being cold
because you think I'll quit too.

15:13.996 --> 15:17.374
But I'm not going to quit
and will do my best.

15:17.875 --> 15:21.921
I can assure you
that tenacity is my forte.

15:26.383 --> 15:29.428
I want to become
a competent producer just like you.

15:30.012 --> 15:35.017
Mr. Park said you also made
many mistakes as a rookie.

15:35.100 --> 15:37.895
But thanks to his guidance,
you were able to grow.

15:37.978 --> 15:38.854
So I--

15:45.027 --> 15:46.570
What are you doing?

15:47.404 --> 15:50.240
I will also learn and grow.

15:52.534 --> 15:55.120
My heart flutters the most before filming.

16:01.043 --> 16:02.252
I mean it.

16:03.587 --> 16:06.799
This is the most exciting part of my life.
Don't you feel the same way?

16:06.882 --> 16:10.177
Hey, cut this nonsense
and go help Chae-ran.

16:10.260 --> 16:11.887
- Yes, sir.
- Leave that here.

16:12.888 --> 16:13.973
Yes, sir.

16:20.813 --> 16:22.648
Why would his heart flutter?

16:58.976 --> 17:00.144
My gosh.

17:00.728 --> 17:02.563
What are you doing here?

17:02.646 --> 17:03.522
I'm sorry.

17:03.605 --> 17:05.858
May I take a few more photos here?

17:06.442 --> 17:08.527
- Here?
- Wait, sir.

17:08.610 --> 17:12.072
Is this building in the drawing
the one we're in front of right now?

17:13.115 --> 17:14.074
SEOUL HARDWARE

17:14.658 --> 17:16.076
SEOUL HARDWARE

17:16.744 --> 17:18.120
Yes, you're right.

17:18.203 --> 17:19.788
See? I told you.

17:19.872 --> 17:22.750
He apparently drew many places
in this neighborhood.

17:23.709 --> 17:27.546
Then sir, do you recognize this place?

17:27.629 --> 17:28.630
Hold on.

17:29.131 --> 17:32.593
That's the flower shop over there.

17:32.676 --> 17:35.387
- Let's stop by. Thank you.
- Thank you.

17:35.471 --> 17:38.849
By the way, what is this?

17:40.726 --> 17:41.727
Ho.

17:41.810 --> 17:42.686
WITH UNG
MEALS WITH RICE

17:42.770 --> 17:46.857
Hey, Chang-sik.
Didn't you stop by this morning?

17:46.940 --> 17:48.567
Once a day will do.

17:48.650 --> 17:52.446
Ung must have really put on quite a show.

17:52.529 --> 17:55.491
- I told you it's not that kind of a show.
- No, listen.

17:55.574 --> 17:59.745
Tourists came by
the hardware store and took photos.

17:59.828 --> 18:02.915
They said they came because they saw
my store in one of his drawings.

18:02.998 --> 18:04.666
Oh, that?

18:05.417 --> 18:06.585
"Oh, that?"

18:06.668 --> 18:11.131
What was that? Why aren't you surprised?

18:11.215 --> 18:13.008
- Come here.
- What?

18:14.676 --> 18:16.678
- Gosh, enjoy the food.
- Thank you.

18:16.762 --> 18:17.971
Enjoy.

18:18.055 --> 18:19.890
- Enjoy.
- It's really good.

18:19.973 --> 18:21.141
What would you like?

18:21.225 --> 18:23.644
Don't stare
when they're eating. It's rude.

18:24.144 --> 18:25.813
I thought it was weird

18:25.896 --> 18:29.608
that we had
a lot of young customers recently.

18:30.192 --> 18:31.401
My goodness.

18:31.485 --> 18:34.780
It seems Ung has become quite famous.

18:34.863 --> 18:38.784
Speaking of which, I'm thinking
about hanging his drawings here

18:38.867 --> 18:40.953
and also in the alley.

18:41.036 --> 18:44.873
Then this alley
will become a popular tourist site.

18:44.957 --> 18:47.292
Honey, don't just stand there.
Help me out.

18:47.376 --> 18:48.252
Coming.

18:48.335 --> 18:51.004
Also, I'm thinking
about wearing a name tag.

18:51.088 --> 18:53.090
It's going to say "Ung's Father".

18:53.173 --> 18:57.177
Or maybe a cap with the same writing.

18:57.261 --> 18:58.971
- Hurry up.
- Okay.

18:59.680 --> 19:00.597
Can you give me…

19:02.349 --> 19:03.809
SEOUL HARDWARE

19:05.185 --> 19:06.603
…one of his drawings?

19:21.952 --> 19:24.037
Our latest project was a big success.

19:24.121 --> 19:25.789
Good job, everyone.

19:25.873 --> 19:27.708
Soen is very pleased.

19:27.791 --> 19:30.210
It's all thanks to Ms. Kook.

19:30.294 --> 19:33.005
I agree. Ms. Kook, thank you.

19:33.088 --> 19:36.466
Ms. Kook, have a great vacation
and good luck on the documentary.

19:36.550 --> 19:38.385
Right. Did you read the news?

19:38.468 --> 19:41.555
Everyone loves Go-oh. Here's the link.

19:43.432 --> 19:44.433
GO-OH AND SOEN'S SYNERGY

19:51.231 --> 19:53.150
WHO IS GO-OH?
NJ AND GO-OH'S SPECIAL RELATIONSHIP

19:59.031 --> 20:01.450
NJ AND GO-OH'S SPECIAL RELATIONSHIP

20:02.075 --> 20:03.744
GO-OH RECEIVED FLOWERS FROM NJ

20:12.044 --> 20:14.254
I doubt it's special.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.759
What are you mumbling to yourself?

20:18.842 --> 20:21.178
What? Were you filming me?

20:22.012 --> 20:24.139
Well, filming is a part of my job.

20:24.723 --> 20:26.350
But I don't do it in secret,
so don't worry.

20:27.059 --> 20:29.019
As I said before, I'm ethical.

20:29.102 --> 20:30.938
How ethical of you to kidnap me.

20:31.021 --> 20:33.523
You would have run away
had I told you beforehand.

20:33.607 --> 20:35.817
I've lost trust in both of you.

20:35.901 --> 20:37.736
At least I explained everything later.

20:37.819 --> 20:39.988
You're getting very annoying these days.

20:40.072 --> 20:41.865
You should make things up for going AWOL.

20:42.449 --> 20:43.992
You shouldn't have run away.

20:44.076 --> 20:46.203
I wouldn't have
had I known this would happen.

20:47.788 --> 20:49.164
Since you're here,

20:49.248 --> 20:51.708
just relax and take your mind off things.

20:51.792 --> 20:54.294
In front of the camera? How relaxing.

20:55.921 --> 20:58.382
Was there anything
you wanted to do on a trip?

20:58.465 --> 21:00.425
I'm not sure. I never thought about that.

21:00.509 --> 21:02.135
Think now. I'll make it come true.

21:02.219 --> 21:04.221
I know this is all for the documentary.

21:06.098 --> 21:07.057
Geez.

21:13.188 --> 21:15.440
So? How's it going?

21:15.524 --> 21:16.608
What do you mean?

21:16.692 --> 21:18.151
That artist you're interested in.

21:18.235 --> 21:20.320
What? Is it already over?

21:20.404 --> 21:22.364
Don't be absurd. It hasn't even begun.

21:23.031 --> 21:24.950
I'm still working on it,

21:26.118 --> 21:27.619
but I did tell him how I feel.

21:27.703 --> 21:30.872
Again? It doesn't surprise me anymore.

21:31.623 --> 21:34.293
What's with the reaction? How could you?

21:34.376 --> 21:36.211
Can you always act surprised?

21:36.295 --> 21:37.796
With your face,

21:37.879 --> 21:40.048
I would have seduced
every single man out there

21:40.132 --> 21:41.675
and made them ask me out.

21:42.467 --> 21:45.012
Why do you always end up
telling them how you feel first?

21:45.554 --> 21:47.764
What's wrong with expressing my feelings?

21:48.598 --> 21:50.475
This is exactly why you're still single.

21:51.143 --> 21:54.187
Speak for yourself.
Were you ever in a relationship?

21:54.771 --> 21:58.692
Well, I just told him how I feel for now.

21:58.775 --> 22:01.945
He must be taken aback.
He needs some time to think.

22:02.029 --> 22:03.322
He must be confused.

22:03.905 --> 22:06.366
One call from me right now,

22:06.450 --> 22:08.160
and he'll be swayed.

22:08.243 --> 22:09.119
MR. CHOI UNG

22:13.081 --> 22:15.876
The person you have called
is not available at the moment.

22:15.959 --> 22:18.295
Please try calling again later.

22:18.378 --> 22:19.838
What? Is he not picking up?

22:20.797 --> 22:23.800
Look at that. You confessed to him,
and he's not picking up.

22:25.719 --> 22:27.179
This is fascinating.

22:27.262 --> 22:30.974
Hey, you're not done here.
Where do you think you're going?

22:31.058 --> 22:33.685
Why isn't he picking up my call?

22:33.769 --> 22:36.188
This will be the end of your interview.

22:36.271 --> 22:40.108
Now, you can spend the time
however you want, and we'll film you.

22:40.192 --> 22:42.486
Tell me what you'd each like to do.

22:47.240 --> 22:48.450
Can I just lie down?

22:49.993 --> 22:50.952
Of course, you can.

22:51.036 --> 22:53.497
Eighty percent of your footage
is of you lying down,

22:53.580 --> 22:54.706
so keep at it.

22:54.790 --> 22:56.666
What difference will it make?

22:56.750 --> 22:58.919
Just lie down and don't ever get up, okay?

23:05.550 --> 23:08.553
Hey, it took ages to reach downtown.

23:09.429 --> 23:12.057
Imtern, how much
of our company's money did you spend?

23:12.140 --> 23:13.475
She said we needed these.

23:13.558 --> 23:15.477
There are many of us.

23:15.560 --> 23:16.728
This isn't much.

23:16.812 --> 23:18.105
Sol-i is an excellent cook.

23:18.188 --> 23:20.065
I don't get why her business is failing.

23:20.148 --> 23:21.608
Shut up and eat your ice cream.

23:24.736 --> 23:26.029
What is this?

23:26.113 --> 23:28.990
Gosh, we paid
for someone else's stuff. Geez.

23:30.158 --> 23:31.910
- What? Did you want this?
- Yes.

23:31.993 --> 23:33.411
It's my favorite.

23:36.414 --> 23:37.749
You're going to draw?

23:38.333 --> 23:40.335
Yes. What else can I do here?

23:40.418 --> 23:41.336
Where are you going?

23:41.419 --> 23:42.963
Not too far, so don't worry.

23:43.547 --> 23:45.465
I saw many beautiful trees.

23:46.049 --> 23:48.885
Put some more clothes on.
It's cold in the mountains.

23:48.969 --> 23:50.679
I'm not going with you.

23:50.762 --> 23:52.681
What? Then who is?

23:52.764 --> 23:53.974
Chae-ran will.

23:55.267 --> 23:56.143
What about you?

23:56.226 --> 23:58.979
I'm going to visit the village
with Yeon-su.

24:00.647 --> 24:03.483
I see. Suit yourself then.

24:04.609 --> 24:07.237
- Are you ready?
- I don't need to get ready.

24:07.320 --> 24:08.572
Can I do whatever I want?

24:09.322 --> 24:11.158
Sure. Whatever you want.

24:12.492 --> 24:13.535
Hey.

24:14.953 --> 24:16.788
What time do I need to be back by?

24:18.415 --> 24:20.542
Well, there's no set time.

24:20.625 --> 24:23.211
This is a rural area,
so it'll get dark soon.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.589
You should come back early.

24:26.131 --> 24:27.048
Let's go, Ung.

24:30.302 --> 24:31.261
"Ung?"

24:32.429 --> 24:34.347
They were never that close.

24:35.891 --> 24:36.975
I'm speechless.

24:38.685 --> 24:39.978
I'm Ung.

24:43.440 --> 24:45.442
I've been feeling frustrated lately.

24:45.525 --> 24:47.903
But now that I'm here,

24:47.986 --> 24:50.655
I feel a little more liberated.

24:51.239 --> 24:54.784
Also, it's been ages
since I've gone on vacation.

24:56.036 --> 24:59.206
Honestly,
I've never really taken any breaks.

24:59.289 --> 25:00.916
So I don't know how to relax.

25:00.999 --> 25:03.126
I think that's why I always work.

25:03.919 --> 25:06.755
I've only gone on one trip
in my entire life.

25:10.759 --> 25:12.302
Don't you think

25:12.928 --> 25:16.598
I'm born to be on camera?
I was just talking endlessly on my own.

25:17.849 --> 25:20.518
Gosh, I did you another favor.

25:24.022 --> 25:25.398
I have a question.

25:25.482 --> 25:26.608
What is it?

25:28.818 --> 25:30.737
How will you film me
if I get on a bicycle?

25:33.657 --> 25:36.952
I can drive, fly a Helicam,

25:37.619 --> 25:39.412
or set up a camera far away.

25:39.496 --> 25:41.748
In any case, it won't be easy.

25:41.831 --> 25:42.958
I see.

25:43.041 --> 25:44.125
Are you going to?

25:45.502 --> 25:47.212
Okay. Let me call the others--

25:47.295 --> 25:49.381
No, don't. Let's make this simple.

25:50.632 --> 25:52.842
- That'll be a headache for me.
- Exactly.

25:54.552 --> 25:57.639
- You were never this childish.
- Is that a no, then?

26:00.725 --> 26:03.353
What are you doing? Go over there.

26:05.522 --> 26:06.481
Hey.

26:26.918 --> 26:29.045
- Are you done?
- Yes. Let's go.

27:23.183 --> 27:24.476
This is boring, right?

27:25.101 --> 27:26.144
It's okay.

27:26.770 --> 27:28.813
He told me to do whatever I wanted.

27:29.898 --> 27:31.608
I'm always this boring.

27:31.691 --> 27:34.861
I know. I saw all the footage
from ten years ago.

27:34.944 --> 27:36.321
I was boring back then too.

27:36.404 --> 27:38.323
That's why I had no expectations.

27:42.827 --> 27:44.704
Stop hanging out with Ji-ung.

27:44.788 --> 27:46.331
You sound just like him right now.

27:47.415 --> 27:49.209
That's a compliment in my line of work.

27:54.798 --> 27:56.091
How was it?

27:56.174 --> 27:57.717
The footage from ten years ago.

27:58.426 --> 28:00.303
Did you not watch it?

28:00.387 --> 28:02.222
There were parts that didn't air.

28:04.057 --> 28:05.517
That was actually the fun part.

28:05.600 --> 28:09.312
If it was up to me,
I would have re-edited the footage.

28:09.396 --> 28:10.230
Why?

28:10.313 --> 28:13.733
They only showed the lives
of the top and the worst students.

28:13.817 --> 28:15.527
There's a lot we missed out on.

28:17.070 --> 28:18.071
Like what?

28:19.114 --> 28:20.615
You're playing dumb.

28:23.118 --> 28:26.329
After watching the footage,
I could tell exactly when you started

28:26.413 --> 28:28.415
developing feelings for her.

28:30.959 --> 28:32.001
Are you teasing me?

28:32.877 --> 28:34.421
Yes. A bit.

28:37.215 --> 28:40.385
Let me repeat myself.
Don't hang out with Ji-ung.

28:47.726 --> 28:50.145
Then what about now?

28:53.106 --> 28:55.442
How do we look from where you're standing?

28:58.361 --> 28:59.738
I think…

29:07.579 --> 29:08.997
I've said enough.

29:09.080 --> 29:11.750
I shouldn't get involved.
That's how this job works.

29:16.171 --> 29:19.591
- You're quite interesting.
- Thanks.

29:20.467 --> 29:24.471
In return, it'd be nice if you
made things more interesting.

29:27.056 --> 29:28.516
I'll do my best.

29:47.118 --> 29:48.912
Why am I the only one who's exhausted?

29:48.995 --> 29:51.080
Why aren't you tired?

29:53.708 --> 29:56.836
Yeon-su, good stamina is a must
if you want to be a producer.

29:56.920 --> 29:58.254
You sicken me.

29:59.088 --> 30:01.382
Right, you used to be
in the track and field team.

30:03.176 --> 30:06.554
- You remember that?
- You were always running under the sun.

30:06.638 --> 30:10.391
But Ung caught my eye even more
since he was always lying in the shade.

30:17.816 --> 30:18.983
This is nice.

30:36.042 --> 30:38.628
I could totally fall asleep right now.

30:38.711 --> 30:41.840
You must be tired
since we left early in the morning.

30:41.923 --> 30:45.218
I never understood people
who took naps under the shade.

30:47.053 --> 30:48.721
So this is how it feels.

30:49.597 --> 30:51.724
Get some shut-eye. We have a lot of time.

30:53.768 --> 30:56.771
If I nap now,
I won't be able to sleep tonight.

31:22.338 --> 31:23.381
Goodness.

31:24.507 --> 31:27.844
I haven't seen you around before.
Are you visiting?

31:27.927 --> 31:29.762
Yes. We'll be staying for a few days.

31:29.846 --> 31:33.391
I see. You two must be on a trip.

31:33.474 --> 31:35.977
Why would you come here
when there's nothing to see?

31:36.060 --> 31:37.604
But the scenery is nice, right?

31:37.687 --> 31:39.898
Yes, it's a beautiful village.

31:39.981 --> 31:41.816
It's quiet and the air is fresh.

31:42.400 --> 31:44.903
There's a small hill over there.

31:44.986 --> 31:49.616
The view from up there
looks marvelous during sundown.

31:49.699 --> 31:52.785
Go take a look with your girlfriend
when she wakes up.

31:53.494 --> 31:54.454
I will. Thank you.

31:56.289 --> 31:59.792
Goodness. It's good
to be young and in love.

31:59.876 --> 32:01.294
Tell me about it.

32:05.673 --> 32:07.842
So I'm your girlfriend.

32:09.802 --> 32:12.555
And we're young and in love.

32:15.224 --> 32:16.351
Are we?

32:22.148 --> 32:25.860
Well, I didn't feel the need
to correct them.

32:27.570 --> 32:29.989
They were just being nice.

32:42.961 --> 32:45.421
You're back.
I've brought the lighting equipment.

32:46.589 --> 32:49.384
Hey, you're back.
By the way, did you see Eun-ho?

32:49.467 --> 32:50.468
Why? Where did he go?

32:50.551 --> 32:53.805
We went out a while ago,
and I abandoned him.

32:54.555 --> 32:56.140
Well done. But why?

32:57.016 --> 33:00.186
He talks too much.

33:00.269 --> 33:01.813
I just can't take it.

33:01.896 --> 33:04.399
Gosh, he nags so much too.

33:04.482 --> 33:06.025
I get it. Well done.

33:09.404 --> 33:12.490
By the way,
are Ji-ung and Yeon-su not back yet?

33:12.573 --> 33:14.283
No, they're not.

33:14.367 --> 33:16.244
I didn't see them during my drive either.

33:16.327 --> 33:17.453
They must have gone far.

33:20.832 --> 33:22.542
It's getting late though.

33:23.376 --> 33:24.877
I'm sure they'll come back.

33:25.628 --> 33:28.089
Gosh, I'm tired of resting here.

33:28.589 --> 33:29.966
I already miss Seoul.

33:32.552 --> 33:33.678
Sol-i.

33:34.470 --> 33:35.763
How could you abandon me?

33:37.306 --> 33:40.351
I walked 7km in these sandals.

33:40.435 --> 33:43.771
Gosh, Eun-ho is back and in tatters!

33:45.565 --> 33:47.734
Hey. I'll give you a piggyback ride.

33:47.817 --> 33:50.028
Forget it. Go away.

33:50.111 --> 33:52.071
Do you even know how much pain I'm in?

33:55.825 --> 33:58.244
- Let's go.
- Gosh.

33:58.327 --> 33:59.370
WITH UNG
MEALS WITH RICE

33:59.454 --> 34:01.789
- Let's go.
- We've never closed this early before.

34:01.873 --> 34:03.624
Gosh, we're out of ingredients.

34:03.708 --> 34:07.420
Let's wrap up the other shops too
and call it a day.

34:07.503 --> 34:09.422
- Goodness.
- Goodness.

34:09.505 --> 34:10.339
Are you closed?

34:10.423 --> 34:13.509
I'm sorry. We've closed early today.

34:13.593 --> 34:16.054
We ran out of ingredients.

34:16.137 --> 34:17.430
So it's empty.

34:18.014 --> 34:19.140
Yes.

34:19.223 --> 34:20.850
That's better for me.

34:20.933 --> 34:22.185
What? Hold on.

34:23.144 --> 34:24.937
She looks familiar.

34:25.021 --> 34:26.856
Is Mr. Choi Ung not here?

34:26.939 --> 34:29.942
I see. Are you a fan of his?

34:30.610 --> 34:33.112
I am, but I'm also here
because he owes me.

34:40.620 --> 34:42.330
- It's good. Try some.
- What?

34:47.043 --> 34:48.586
- It's a bit bland.
- Is it?

34:49.170 --> 34:51.214
This is bland? Is he serious?

34:52.840 --> 34:53.841
Gosh.

34:56.302 --> 34:58.262
Yeon-su, try this.

35:03.059 --> 35:05.019
This is bland? Gosh, that's infuriating.

35:06.312 --> 35:08.147
- Do we have salt?
- Yes, it's in there.

35:10.525 --> 35:13.653
What are you doing? Come out.
Let's eat dinner and call it a day.

35:15.071 --> 35:17.782
- You must have had a lot to film.
- I guess. Why do you ask?

35:18.825 --> 35:21.494
Well, it's just that you came back late.

35:22.286 --> 35:23.371
With Yeon-su.

35:27.625 --> 35:28.584
Never mind.

35:29.293 --> 35:31.754
Also, don't let your juniors
take after you.

35:32.839 --> 35:34.215
Chae-ran must have done well.

35:34.298 --> 35:36.717
Geez. You're a bad influence.

35:36.801 --> 35:37.927
Gosh.

35:51.482 --> 35:55.194
Here. Eat up since it was
a tough day for you.

35:55.278 --> 35:57.947
Sol-i, I can't feel my legs. Am I okay?

35:58.030 --> 36:00.032
It's okay. Rest up, and you'll be fine.

36:00.116 --> 36:02.827
My hands are trembling too.
Why won't it stop?

36:02.910 --> 36:05.371
It's just your imagination. Dig in.

36:06.455 --> 36:09.584
Should we drink later?
You guys better not sleep early today.

36:09.667 --> 36:11.961
We'll be drinking all night, so eat up.

36:12.044 --> 36:15.673
Right. Where did you guys go?
What took you so long?

36:15.756 --> 36:17.216
Somewhere nice?

36:17.300 --> 36:20.970
Well, we biked around the village

36:21.554 --> 36:22.805
and took a nap.

36:23.389 --> 36:25.391
A nap? Outside?

36:25.474 --> 36:27.268
Yes. Why?

36:28.227 --> 36:30.897
Didn't you think
people who took naps were pathetic?

36:34.233 --> 36:36.903
I'm on a trip. I can do whatever I want.

36:37.695 --> 36:38.905
I don't know about that.

36:38.988 --> 36:42.366
Don't you like having
a tight schedule when you're on a trip?

36:43.618 --> 36:46.287
Not every time.
And it also depends on who I'm with.

36:48.497 --> 36:51.876
- You must have gone on many trips.
- I've had my fair share.

36:58.424 --> 37:01.219
- You're getting a call.
- He is?

37:01.302 --> 37:02.470
It's your dad.

37:02.553 --> 37:04.388
What? It's a video call.

37:04.472 --> 37:05.932
I didn't know he could do this.

37:06.515 --> 37:07.725
He's never done it before.

37:07.808 --> 37:09.602
It must be important. Answer it.

37:09.685 --> 37:10.811
- Go on.
- Okay.

37:11.354 --> 37:12.438
The reception is poor.

37:15.399 --> 37:17.026
Hey. It's Ung.

37:17.109 --> 37:20.947
Hi, Ung. How are you?

37:21.030 --> 37:22.406
Did you arrive safely?

37:22.490 --> 37:26.160
You should have called us to let us know.

37:26.244 --> 37:29.247
Dad, who taught you
how to make a video call?

37:29.747 --> 37:31.666
How is Ji-ung doing?

37:32.583 --> 37:35.086
Sure. Your other son is doing fine.

37:35.169 --> 37:37.922
Ji-ung, hi.

37:38.005 --> 37:39.966
Are you having dinner?

37:40.049 --> 37:41.759
Is Yeon-su there too?

37:42.593 --> 37:44.845
- Well…
- Yes, I'm here too.

37:44.929 --> 37:46.597
Did you have dinner?

37:46.681 --> 37:48.266
Of course, we did.

37:48.349 --> 37:51.269
How is it there? Is it nice?
Are you eating well?

37:51.352 --> 37:54.480
I love it here. The scenery is beautiful
and the air is fresh.

37:54.563 --> 37:57.233
You should take a break
and come here for vacation too.

37:57.316 --> 38:00.069
Of course. We'll ask Ung
to take care of the restaurant

38:00.152 --> 38:02.989
and we'll go on a trip.

38:03.072 --> 38:06.784
Right, Ung. Your friend is here.

38:07.827 --> 38:08.828
My friend?

38:09.745 --> 38:11.414
But all my friends are here.

38:11.497 --> 38:12.456
I'm disappointed.

38:12.540 --> 38:15.293
What? NJ! Why are you there?

38:15.376 --> 38:17.169
What? NJ?

38:18.296 --> 38:20.506
Are you holding a memorial service?
Pull it out.

38:21.882 --> 38:24.218
You haven't run away from me, have you?

38:24.302 --> 38:26.053
Gosh. Goodness.

38:26.721 --> 38:28.472
Hey, I'll be back.

38:28.556 --> 38:30.683
- Me too. Let's go.
- Sit down.

39:14.060 --> 39:15.227
I…

39:31.118 --> 39:33.788
Why did I avoid him like a fool?

40:11.492 --> 40:12.827
Hi, Grandma.

40:13.661 --> 40:14.745
Were you sleeping?

40:15.996 --> 40:17.915
I must have woken you up.

40:19.708 --> 40:21.794
But you sound half asleep.

40:31.053 --> 40:32.221
What is it?

40:32.304 --> 40:35.516
Nothing. Just go to bed early
since we have to shoot tomorrow.

40:35.599 --> 40:39.103
You're being cruel by telling me
to sleep when it's not even 10 p.m.

40:39.854 --> 40:42.148
- What about your pills?
- I had no time to pack them.

40:43.566 --> 40:45.401
Do you want some hot milk?

40:45.484 --> 40:48.112
That's fine. Where are you sleeping?

40:48.195 --> 40:50.698
We got our own place.
We'll come back here tomorrow morning.

40:51.449 --> 40:52.408
Okay.

41:02.001 --> 41:03.085
What is it?

41:03.169 --> 41:05.838
Just say it already,
unless you want to be here all night.

41:07.339 --> 41:09.049
We decided to change the angle

41:09.842 --> 41:12.636
and focus more on you
and Yeon-su's emotions

41:12.720 --> 41:13.971
And?

41:14.054 --> 41:16.015
It confuses me the more I film you two.

41:16.098 --> 41:18.350
Your feelings towards Yeon-su.

41:19.059 --> 41:22.938
Whether it's because of
your past relationship, or…

41:24.356 --> 41:25.441
Or?

41:31.155 --> 41:32.865
Ms. Jung told me today

41:34.366 --> 41:36.785
that people behind the camera
shouldn't get involved.

41:39.914 --> 41:41.373
What are you curious about?

41:43.292 --> 41:44.960
That only applies…

41:47.630 --> 41:49.089
when I'm filming.

41:54.303 --> 41:57.640
I have many questions,
but I'll ask next time. Good night.

42:31.507 --> 42:33.634
It really feels like you're back, Yeon-su.

42:34.301 --> 42:36.512
I'm really sick of this.

42:40.683 --> 42:42.518
Isn't it the same for you?

42:42.601 --> 42:43.978
You must be sick of this too.

42:46.355 --> 42:49.316
We fight, avoid each other, and run away.

42:49.400 --> 42:50.609
That's what we do.

42:51.402 --> 42:52.945
And now, here we are.

42:54.446 --> 42:55.864
What can we do though?

43:08.002 --> 43:09.336
I'm disappointed.

43:12.006 --> 43:13.841
Hey, I'll be back.

43:19.179 --> 43:21.265
It's none of my business now.

43:22.349 --> 43:23.559
Let's forget about it.

43:28.689 --> 43:30.316
Any memorable trips?

43:32.359 --> 43:35.821
I'm not sure.
I don't really enjoy going on trips.

43:35.904 --> 43:37.656
There's nothing memorable.

43:52.671 --> 43:54.548
That hurt.

44:11.315 --> 44:13.108
It confuses me the more I film you two.

44:13.692 --> 44:15.569
Your feelings towards Yeon-su.

44:16.528 --> 44:19.198
Whether it's because of
your past relationship

44:19.698 --> 44:20.699
or…

44:27.289 --> 44:29.291
Is it the past
that makes me uncomfortable?

44:30.626 --> 44:32.086
That's exactly what it is.

44:34.755 --> 44:36.131
But here's the problem.

44:36.882 --> 44:38.425
Despite being in the past…

44:40.094 --> 44:41.470
It was hectic, wasn't it?

44:42.262 --> 44:44.515
This was my first trip,
so I'm still new to it.

44:45.808 --> 44:48.936
Next time, let's stay longer
and go farther away.

44:49.019 --> 44:50.813
If we fight

44:51.355 --> 44:52.481
or break up again,

44:53.816 --> 44:56.902
just come to me like you did today.

45:01.198 --> 45:04.451
I think I love you.

45:07.663 --> 45:09.665
…it's all too vivid.

45:42.406 --> 45:44.700
Did someone tranquilize me last night?

45:44.783 --> 45:48.912
My gosh. I haven't slept this well
in a very long time.

45:48.996 --> 45:51.081
Sol-i, how could you
fall asleep after dinner

45:51.165 --> 45:53.625
when you said we'd party all night long?

45:53.709 --> 45:55.836
By the way, what's wrong with your face?

45:55.919 --> 45:58.464
Were there a lot of bugs last night?

45:58.547 --> 46:00.382
This is how I look in the morning.

46:00.466 --> 46:02.718
Did you sleep well? Where are the others?

46:02.801 --> 46:05.596
Right. If your schedule
isn't too hectic today,

46:05.679 --> 46:07.264
can you let Yeon-su sleep in?

46:07.347 --> 46:09.850
She probably hasn't slept in
like that in ages.

46:09.933 --> 46:11.393
Ung too.

46:11.477 --> 46:13.687
He must have gone to bed late
after drawing all night.

46:13.770 --> 46:16.315
Why would he work during the trip?
It's heartbreaking.

46:17.316 --> 46:20.110
Sure. Let's take it easy.
They're on vacation after all.

46:20.194 --> 46:21.987
Let's check out the site.

46:22.070 --> 46:24.656
But don't you worry about your footage.

46:25.407 --> 46:26.408
You have us.

46:26.492 --> 46:28.494
Right. We'll let you film us instead.

46:30.037 --> 46:31.121
- Let's wrap it up.
- Okay.

46:38.295 --> 46:39.254
Sol-i.

46:56.104 --> 46:57.898
What? Where is everyone?

47:14.164 --> 47:16.291
Are you in there?

48:11.305 --> 48:13.765
Did he have trouble sleeping again?

49:54.199 --> 49:55.450
Was he awake?

49:57.202 --> 49:58.203
Yeon-su.

50:00.330 --> 50:01.206
Yeon-su?

50:02.666 --> 50:04.918
- Yes?
- What distracted you so much?

50:05.669 --> 50:08.338
I'm sorry. What did you just say?

50:08.422 --> 50:10.590
Let's finish the interview
on our way down.

50:10.674 --> 50:14.136
A villager told us about this place
that's beautiful during sundown.

50:14.219 --> 50:15.846
Okay. Sure.

50:20.851 --> 50:22.894
- Let me change the battery.
- Sure.

50:25.605 --> 50:27.524
What? Why aren't you with Chae-ran?

50:27.607 --> 50:29.818
She told me to stay with you instead.

50:29.901 --> 50:31.653
Who do you think you should listen to?

50:31.737 --> 50:34.030
But it seems I came at the right time.

50:34.114 --> 50:36.283
Gosh, she always
makes me do things instead.

50:36.908 --> 50:39.161
Goodness. You're that man from yesterday.

50:39.244 --> 50:40.996
Hello. We meet again.

50:41.079 --> 50:42.789
You must have come in a group.

50:42.873 --> 50:44.416
You're all handsome.

50:45.083 --> 50:47.169
- Where are you going?
- Home, of course.

50:47.252 --> 50:50.380
Right. Did you visit that place
with your girlfriend yesterday?

50:50.464 --> 50:52.591
She's probably
on her way there as we speak.

50:52.674 --> 50:56.178
Geez, not today. It's going to rain soon.

50:56.261 --> 50:58.096
I doubt it will.

50:58.180 --> 51:01.391
Goodness. Can you not tell?

51:01.475 --> 51:04.352
You should hurry back
before you get soaked.

51:04.978 --> 51:08.315
You should have gone there yesterday.
It's a marvelous place. Goodness.

51:10.609 --> 51:12.861
Let's do our final interview here.

51:12.944 --> 51:14.988
Tell me your thoughts on this trip.

51:15.071 --> 51:16.114
Okay.

51:17.324 --> 51:20.452
Wait. I'm low on battery.

51:21.119 --> 51:22.871
I think it'll turn off midway.

51:23.705 --> 51:24.915
I should have packed extra.

51:24.998 --> 51:27.292
I think this has happened before.

51:28.335 --> 51:29.544
Is it a déjà vu?

51:30.879 --> 51:33.548
Should we just go back
to the village and finish up there?

51:33.632 --> 51:37.886
Well, let's just do it here.
You said the view was beautiful.

51:37.969 --> 51:41.223
Then let me go get
some extra batteries and lighting.

51:41.306 --> 51:42.682
Please wait here.

52:01.576 --> 52:06.957
Lately, it feels like I've been spending
quite a bit of time avoiding Ung.

52:20.053 --> 52:21.263
Sol-i.

52:21.346 --> 52:22.430
Yes?

52:23.098 --> 52:24.808
I have a question.

52:26.643 --> 52:27.894
Okay. I'm listening.

52:29.396 --> 52:30.689
What are we…

52:32.190 --> 52:33.567
having for dinner?

52:34.901 --> 52:38.530
I see. You're always curious
about the most useless things.

52:38.613 --> 52:40.282
It's actually quite important.

52:40.907 --> 52:43.869
- Light a fire if you're that hungry.
- It's cold.

52:43.952 --> 52:45.537
You spat at me.

52:45.620 --> 52:46.997
You're disgusting. Go away.

52:48.039 --> 52:52.043
Geez. You have a knack
for saying the rudest things.

52:52.127 --> 52:55.589
- Hey. My spit would land on me, not you.
- Gosh.

52:55.672 --> 52:56.756
Gosh, that's cold.

52:57.257 --> 52:58.300
- What?
- What?

52:58.383 --> 52:59.676
It landed on me too.

52:59.759 --> 53:01.052
- What is this?
- What?

53:01.136 --> 53:02.220
Is it raining?

53:03.471 --> 53:05.891
- What? Just out of the blue like this?
- Gosh.

53:06.391 --> 53:07.601
- Darn it.
- Come on.

53:07.684 --> 53:09.185
I spent an hour doing my hair!

53:09.269 --> 53:11.354
I told you we should have stayed inside!

53:28.288 --> 53:29.456
What's going on?

53:31.207 --> 53:32.667
Is it raining?

53:32.751 --> 53:34.711
They didn't say it'd rain.

53:49.559 --> 53:51.770
This is definitely a déjà vu.

54:03.198 --> 54:05.158
How refreshing.

54:12.332 --> 54:16.544
I wish the rain would clear my head
of all this needless worrying.

55:17.313 --> 55:18.773
It really is him.

55:26.489 --> 55:28.158
What are you doing there?

55:30.201 --> 55:31.119
Thinking.

55:32.037 --> 55:33.079
About what?

55:36.499 --> 55:39.919
About why I've come to you once again.

55:43.882 --> 55:45.967
How can I explain this?

55:47.469 --> 55:48.845
I must be cursed.

55:53.058 --> 55:55.477
You shouldn't have said that then.

55:57.145 --> 55:59.856
Is it me again? It's my fault?

56:00.565 --> 56:02.484
Yes. It's you again.

56:03.359 --> 56:05.361
I'm sick of it, but it's you again.

56:11.451 --> 56:13.578
Then just go. Don't just stand there.

56:16.247 --> 56:18.291
Am I really cursed?

56:24.047 --> 56:25.590
Then I'll go.

56:45.860 --> 56:48.571
Or has this ridiculous trip bewitched me?

56:58.665 --> 57:00.458
Should I leave or stay?

57:06.005 --> 57:08.383
Should I leave or stay?

57:09.676 --> 57:10.927
Or maybe…

57:15.849 --> 57:18.518
I knew all along…

58:09.027 --> 58:12.405
that this would happen
from the very moment we met again.

58:27.545 --> 58:29.005
We're not going to break up.

58:30.798 --> 58:34.260
If we fight or break up again,

58:34.969 --> 58:37.972
just come to me like you did today.

58:40.141 --> 58:42.101
- And then?
- And then…

58:44.020 --> 58:47.482
I'll grab onto you and never let go.

58:54.531 --> 59:01.204
JANGAN, HOGOK-RI, IHWA-RI, GOON-RI

59:01.287 --> 59:08.294
BEFORE SUNSET

59:30.608 --> 59:32.151
I must be losing my mind.

59:32.235 --> 59:35.697
But he hasn't called me since then.

59:35.780 --> 59:36.781
Ms. Kook.

59:36.864 --> 59:39.200
What's going on between you and Ms. Kook?

59:39.284 --> 59:42.287
Are you worried that Ung might say

59:43.288 --> 59:44.497
that it was all a mistake?

59:44.581 --> 59:46.916
Do you like Ms. Kook, Ji-ung?

59:47.750 --> 59:51.004
I have no idea what you're thinking
so I want to find out.

59:51.588 --> 59:52.547
Can I stay over?

59:53.256 --> 59:55.425
I have something I want to hear from you.

59:56.175 --> 59:57.719
So I want to hear you say it now.

59:58.928 --> 01:00:03.933
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
